es as a way to punish Donald  Trump or make him suffer consequences  for the things that he did I believe  that that ship has sailed  we can as a practical matter vote Donald  Trump out  way faster than the hush money payment  investigation could even potentially  remove him from office it's just not  going to happen we shouldn't even be  thinking about that then we get to the  content of the tax returns themselves  that's actually what we're interested in  now that being said this is a district  attorney subpoena for an investigation  if they get the tax returns meaning if  the grand jury gets those tax returns  they would not even go public unless  they're leaked of course unless they end  up becoming evidence at a trial that is  also extremely unlikely to happen so I  don't really see this as something to be  optimistic about in terms of the  material getting to us for our review  but it's yet another thing that could  trigger Donald Trump first of all  secondly every time that we do hear  anything related to the content of  Donald Trump's taxes it's been something  that makes him look terrible so there is  still the potential here that if any of  this is released in any way leaked or  otherwise it's going to contain  extremely damaging information about  Donald Trump remember that when the  summaries of Donald Trump's tax returns  got out we learned that he lost just  like insane amounts of money and they  put out his attorney or someone put out  a statement saying oh this is all  calculated  you know he's gaming the system and this  is all because he's such a great  businessman people who were not working  for Trump who know about tax law and  accounting looked at it and said no no  no this is just the guy's really losing  a lot a lot of money or he lost a lot of  money in that time it would not be for  the tax benefits we also learned from  other tax disclosures of Trump that we  got a while ago that Donald Trump's dad  had financed a lot of Donald Trump's  fa